      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the context.Now I understand the test. Let me write an improved, more readable version.\n\nThe test creates a stream with an offset (20) beyond the array length (2), placing the stream at end-of-data immediately. It then verifies that `skip()` returns 0 and `available()` returns 0.The improved test compiled successfully."
